{"id":"5b52f2915b942520","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-primeimp.md","title":"Prime implicant","display":"df-primeimp — Prime implicant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-primeimp","aliases":["27-df-primeimp"],"display":"df-primeimp — Prime implicant","depends_on":["[[27-df-impset]]","[[27-df-litset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.7 Definition 1.18; Theorem 1.11","source_printed_pages":"26","source_pdf_pages":"50","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-primeimp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-primeimp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primeimp — Prime implicant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.7 Definition 1.18; Theorem 1.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"26"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"50"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T_L\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)\">\\(L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>；本节定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeImp}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeImp}\\)</span> 是项与布尔函数之间的二元谓词符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeImp}(T_L,f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;T_L\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\land\\forall\\ell\\in L\\;(T_{L\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}\\notin\\mathrm{Imp}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeImp}(T_L,f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;T_L\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\land\\forall\\ell\\in L\\;(T_{L\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}\\notin\\mathrm{Imp}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义在所有项上给出真假值，不能在 Hypothesis 中先假定该项已经是 implicant。删除单个文字足以检验极大性：任何真子文字集可通过一串删除到达。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anc